  "description": "D5.3.1-D5.3.2: mutual recursion and the string length leaf are NO_GC, so their caller uses a rootless native stack guard. S7.7.3 (2026-10-31): contract-safe inlining may leave either mutual-component member as the call target; both must retain the same rootless guard and NO_GC closure.",
